OL,3,GNEWSACrochet novices create cascading
OL,4,Apoppy memorial
OL,5,
OL,6,FNovice crocheters have transformed a
OL,7,Fvillage church with a cascade of
OL,8,Fwoollen memorial poppies.
OL,10,FCaroline Moore and Wendy Ireland took
OL,11,Fup their crochet hooks last November
OL,12,Fwith the aim of creating a display for
OL,13,Ftheir village of Friston in Suffolk.
OL,15,FThe pair said they came up with the
OL,16,Fidea after "a few glasses of wine"
OL,17,Fafter being inspired by a display on
OL,18,FSouthend Pier in Essex last November
OL,19,Fwhich they saw on social media.
OL,21,F"Many hours of love and thought have
OL,22,Fgone into this," said Ireland.
